---
const highlights = ['AI 功能模块', '项目协作补位', '小场景自动化交付'];
---

<section id="home" class="snap-section relative isolate min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 px-5 pt-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-0 -z-10 h-[34rem] w-[48rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-100/55 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[-10rem] top-36 -z-10 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-blue-200/35 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="section-inner grid min-h-[calc(100svh-5rem)] items-center gap-10 py-8 lg:-translate-y-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.02fr_0.98fr] lg:py-10">
    <div class="fade-in">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Shanyuxing Technology</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-[45rem] text-[2.08rem] font-medium leading-[1.18] tracking-normal text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.08rem] lg:leading-[1.12]">
        <span class="block">为企业服务商和中小团队，</span>
        <span class="blue-gradient-text block font-semibold">交付可落地的 AI 功能模块</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-[43rem] text-[1.05rem] leading-8 text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
        山欲行科技提供 AI 应用开发与自动化交付服务，支持软件公司、企业服务商、代运营团队和有明确场景的中小企业，将客服知识库、表格分析、外贸回复、评论分类等业务环节做成可用的 AI 工具与半自动化流程。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[40rem] text-base leading-8 text-slate-500">
        我们不做泛泛的“智能化转型”包装，更适合从一个明确的小场景、一个功能模块或一次项目协作开始。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a class="pill-button pill-primary" href="#contact">
          我是企业服务商，想合作
        </a>
        <a class="pill-button pill-secondary" href="#examples">
          我有具体业务场景
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {highlights.map((item) => (
          <span class="rounded-full border border-brand-100/80 bg-white/75 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">{item}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in relative">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-brand-200/45 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="surface-card relative overflow-hidden p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative rounded-[1rem] border border-white/80 bg-slate-50/70 p-4 sm:p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">AI 功能模块交付</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">从项目协作或明确场景出发</p>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-brand-100/85 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-700 ring-1 ring-brand-200/70">Module</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative mt-6 grid gap-4">
            <div class="absolute left-[1.1rem] top-7 h-[calc(100%-3.5rem)] w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-200 via-slate-200 to-brand-100"></div>
            <div class="relative rounded-[0.9rem] border border-white/90 bg-white/88 p-4 pl-12 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">
              <span class="absolute left-4 top-5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-brand-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(219,234,254,0.9)]"></span>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">输入</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:text-base">客户需求、业务资料、表格、工单、知识文档</p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative rounded-[0.9rem] border border-white/90 bg-white/88 p-4 pl-12 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">
              <span class="absolute left-4 top-5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-brand-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(219,234,254,0.9)]"></span>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">处理</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:text-base">模块开发、规则约束、资料检索、系统对接与人工确认</p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative rounded-[0.9rem] border border-white/90 bg-white/88 p-4 pl-12 shadow-sm backdrop-blur">
              <span class="absolute left-4 top-5 h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-brand-500 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(219,234,254,0.9)]"></span>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">输出</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:text-base">可嵌入项目的功能模块、半自动化流程与交付说明</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
